{"title":"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42c06de735d79f0b28c30bcbbcf96e67bb1ca42c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c, d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a59bb1293ee3f6dec19de4019a7178874219ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be five consecutive terms in an arithmetic sequence, and suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/e/3ce606c4782d0356e6d0bf46b6227689a777d6e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d+e=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"174\" height=\"14\" />. Which of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/d/52d9871f0ebe04faa75b50d7055c8a05d08120c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c, d,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a59bb1293ee3f6dec19de4019a7178874219ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> can be found?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/74784916463b94c2c05248c80fe81f06c38d3963.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textrm{(A)} \\ a\\qquad \\textrm{(B)}\\ b\\qquad \\textrm{(C)}\\ c\\qquad \\textrm{(D)}\\ d\\qquad \\textrm{(E)}\\ e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"328\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> be the common difference between the terms.\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/e/17eb578b02b0e257341e003a04ea99b68464123e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=c-2f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/1/d0108f0c0362f604d3e1e6ffb9e34f4db70ce7a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=c-f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/3437ab942d89f42ffef2cb4cb27634ccfa156417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=c$\" width=\"40\" height=\"8\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/7/fe71729db194dcf73a0317f27bbd062cffcf8c9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=c+f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/2/7728d895da60a7f27e8629dc46abe1dcc7e20fac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e=c+2f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" /></li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/5/9554e32ca50549a3f8153f10e96f4a4d98e7a0bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d+e=5c=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"215\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/b/4eb76404ee79952dcc555464b061509299789b09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. But we can't find any more variables, because we don't know what <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is. So the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77dff1dfc319011b04dfe423c8cf864e4a1e93c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textrm{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"11\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A\">2007 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_